<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλευθερ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set free</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς Ἀθήνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.62
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰωνίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.137
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρίδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					403
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					1046
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.144
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δούλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.15
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸν ἔσπλουν</span>
			<i>set</i> the entrance <i>free, clear</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.51
			</span></i>; <i>release</i> a debtor, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.59
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τό γ᾽ εἰς ἑαυτὸν πᾶν ἐλευθεροῖ
				στόμα</span> he <i>keeps</i> his tongue altogether
				<i>free</i>, i.e. does not commit himself by speech, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				706
			</span></i>; <i>free from blame, acquit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					1.7.26
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be set free</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.95
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				127
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυράννων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.62
				</span></i>
			; <i>indulge in licence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				575a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.gen.,
				<i>set free, release from</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1449
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					566e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρότρου βοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					5.23
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλευθεροῦντες ἐκ δρασμῶν
				πόδα</span>, i.e. ceasing to flee, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				1010
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶνδε τῶν τόπων ἐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				114b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τῶν πλουσίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					569a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
